{# 用途: Agent 工具描述模板，列出可用工具供 LLM 选择调用 #}
{# 版本: v1.0.0 | 变更记录见 docs/prompt-changelog.md #}
You have access to the following tools:

{% for tool in tools %}
- {{ tool.name }}: {{ tool.description }}
  Parameters: {{ tool.parameters | tojson }}
{% endfor %}

To use a tool, respond with a JSON object:
{"tool": "<tool_name>", "arguments": {<parameters>}}

If no tool is needed, respond directly to the user.
